Value Filldown prefix ([0-9a-fA-F:.]+/\d+)
Value as_path (\d+(?:\s+\d+)*)
Value nexthop ([0-9a-fA-F:.]+)
Value peer_ip ([0-9a-fA-F:.]+)
Value origin (\w+)
Value med (\d+)
Value local_pref (\d+)
Value communities (\d+:\d+(?:\s+\d+:\d+)*)
Value large_communities (\d+:\d+:\d+(?:\s+\d+:\d+:\d+)*)
Value best (best)
Value age (\S+)

Start
  ^\s*BGP routing table entry for\s+${prefix}
  ^\s+(?P<_as>${as_path})(?:\s+\(aggregated\s+by\s+\d+\s+\S+\))?\s*$$
  ^\s+${nexthop}\s+(?:\(metric\s+\d+\)\s+)?from\s+${peer_ip}\s+\(\S+\)
  ^\s+Origin\s+${origin}(?:,\s+metric\s+${med})?(?:,\s+localpref\s+${local_pref})?(?:,[^\n]*?\b${best}\b[^\n]*|,[^\n]*)?\s*$$
  ^\s+Received\s+${age}\s+ago(?:,[^\n]*?\b${best}\b[^\n]*|,[^\n]*)?\s*$$
  ^\s+Community:\s+${communities}\s*$$
  ^\s+Extended Community:.*$$
  ^\s+Large Community:\s+${large_communities}\s*$$
  ^\s+Rx SAFI:.*$$ -> Record
  ^\s+Last update:\s+${age}\s+ago -> Record
  ^\s*$$
